            "displayName": "Robert Muir",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "Simon you are right, I only did the public scope javadoc (and some of the comments). I thought this was most important for now, since it would be what the users see.\n\nyou are correct there are some package/private/protected javadocs that i didn't get to.\nthere are also main methods, commented out test code as you mentioned.\nfinally, basically all the classes are in public scope, and many internal-only classes should instead be package protected (imho). This might involve reorganizing the files a bit.\n\nLet me know if you want me to do these things as well.\n\nThanks",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=rcmuir",
            "name": "rcmuir",
            "key": "rcmuir",
